<title>LATVIA: Latvian unemployment 7.3 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Latvian unemployment 7.3 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian unemployment rose slightly</p>
<p>to 7.3 percent in January from a 7.2 percent level registered in</p>
<p>December 1996, the statistics committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     Jan '97    Dec '96   Jan '96</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)   7.3	 7.2	 6.6</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	91,500    90,800    83,800</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
